%% M1 target design, not a trace of a successful live run.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as StethoFuse browser
    participant Firebase as Firebase Authentication
    participant API as FastAPI protected endpoint
    participant Store as Trusted account and grant store
    participant Media as Private server media
    User->>Browser: Sign in through selected provider
    Browser->>Firebase: Provider authentication
    Firebase-->>Browser: Firebase user and ID token
    Browser->>API: Bearer ID token and resource ID
    API->>Firebase: Official Admin SDK verification and current user check
    alt Missing invalid revoked or disabled identity
        API-->>Browser: Sanitized denial, no protected data
    else Verified UID
        API->>Store: Resolve UID and current account status
        Note over API,Store: Controlled onboarding defaults to healthcare_staff
        API->>Store: Check current role and owner or active scoped grant
        alt Object permission denied
            API-->>Browser: Forbidden or non-disclosing not found
        else Authorized operation
            API->>Media: Resolve approved resource and open private file
            Media-->>API: Authorized bytes
            API-->>Browser: Protected response
        end
    end
    Note over API,Store: Admin metadata permission does not bypass private-media checks
    Note over User,Store: First-admin bootstrap is a separate trusted operator action after real UID verification and approval, never an email rule or public request
